<title>USA: NY Job Development Authority repricing updated.</title>
<headline>NY Job Development Authority repricing updated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced New York Job Development Authority's $84.8 million bond deal, lowering yields in both tax-exempt maturities.</p>
<p>The updated repricing follows:</p>
